{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_tr01_beg",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_tr01",
  "title": "来袭！天空的王者！",
  "storyCode": "CF-TR-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_tr01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eef0941a561e9468493299f78e98628a871158ac9af1c7f4e97db40daffd4001",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "往左。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "够了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "往右再回一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "还是不行......把脚踮起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角......踮高一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好，就这样，保持住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "啊，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "肩膀不要晃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "俺在努力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "快了，再坚持一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "完成了，放我下来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "（喘气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "这一次采集到的样品质量不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，俺有一个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "俺觉得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "把镊子递给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "好，是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "封口条。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "给。那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不是这个，是那个蓝色的。注意样品分类。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "对了，你要说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "俺......俺觉得下次出野外任务之前，俺们是不是可以申请一个梯子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "否决，过重的装备负担会影响野外行动的机动性，遭遇突发事件将会难以应对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好了，这份样品也拿去检测一下，希望这次能找到点东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "所以为什么要申请梯子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "......没事，不要往心里去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "样品的初步检测结果，活性源石微粒，未检出，和之前一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "竟然还是没有......我们采集了多少份样品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "空气检测、土壤采样、生物采样、环境表面采样......共十七个采样点，二十三份样品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我再确认一遍，二十三份样品都没有检测出任何异常？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我想想，前两日这片山地附近下了很大的雨，对活性源石微粒的检测或许会有所影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "一路上你还有注意到其他的异常状况吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "俺想想，那几棵折断烧焦的树算吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "那大概是雨中被雷劈断的......要是这能称得上异常的话，森林里得有一头又会喷火又横冲直撞的超大怪物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "虽然不想承认毫无收获，但依照现有的检测结果，继续在自然采样上花时间显然效率不高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "换个调查方向吧，直接从当地的感染者中了解，你觉得可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "嗯，调查行动轨迹对确认源石的来源会很有帮助，但是有一点需要注意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "因为丘陵地形，这附近的村落与外界接触很少，和当地人的交流预计会有不低的沟通成本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "没事，我会说服他们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "最近的疑似病例来自露华村，就是在这山脚下的村庄，俺们去那里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "嗯？病例居然是村庄报告的，他们主动联系上了罗德岛，并寻求了医疗援助，真少见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "下山的时候记得多留心一下，可能有什么被忽视的细节。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（按下录音键）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "第一次语音记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "时间，早晨七时三十七分。天气，晴朗。位置，东国苍暮山地北部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛A4行动组，我是组长夜刀，正在与干员黑角执行该区域的矿石病应对任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "情报显示，最近一段时间内附近发现了多起疑似矿石病感染的事件，推测发生了异常的源石粉尘扩散现象，尚不排除存在人为因素。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "当前所处的位置是苍暮山地的森林外围，我们对当地环境进行了初步的勘察与采样工作，截止到该条语音记录前，未发现环境异......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，快来这里！俺有个大发现！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "暂停一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "是什么，呃......这就是你说的大发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "枯叶下面的一堆虫子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "是水蝇的幼虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哎......俺看到的时候觉得有点奇怪，你一问俺，俺又搞忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你再好好想想......暂未发现环境异常情况，调查仍将继续进行，记录完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "啊，俺记起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "记起来什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "之前博士让俺多读点书嘛，俺就找薄绿推荐了几本。有一本叫《源石虫都能读懂的泰拉生物百科》，里面好多插画，特别有意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "说重点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "那本书上有讲到水蝇的生活环境，水蝇在繁殖期时会在水洼里产卵，它们的小虫子就在浅浅的水里生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "等到完全长大了，咻——就飞走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "你的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "这地上都是叶子，没有水洼呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "或许水蝇幼虫也能在潮湿的环境中生存？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "书上没有提到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "等等......这周围确实有密集的树丛，但分布也算均匀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "为什么唯独在这里会积下这么多叶子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "得把这些树叶挖开看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你为什么看向俺，俺也没有申请铲子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "好吧，俺来挖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "啊，好大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角，你在书上有读到过这个吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "东国的山地里......会有这么大的羽兽吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "俺不记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好惊人的爪痕......形状像是羽兽的爪子，长度却几乎和我的刀相当，土壤深深地凹陷下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "能够留下这样爪痕的生物，应该和一间屋子差不多大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "要是真有这种体型的生物......要是被刻俄柏看到，她一定会很开心的，能够她吃好几顿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "也足够把我们撕碎好几次了......\n嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角，把采样管给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "给，别忘了防护措施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "（在爪痕上采集样品）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好了，你拿去检测一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "结果出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "活性源石微粒，检出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "竟然真是这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "巨大的生物......没有查询到类似痕迹的记载，附近地区也没有相关的目击报告，是凭空出现的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黄色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，有喵......呸呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不对，还得考虑是否是活着的生物留下的痕迹。如此庞大体型的羽兽，我很难想象它该长成什么样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "而且，在爪痕上检测到了活性源石微粒，源石究竟从何而来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "啊，难道说......那些堆上去的叶子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黄色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "喵喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角，不要发出奇怪的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我们得先尽快把这个爪痕记录下来，你去拿设备来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "不是俺发出的声音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你说什......\n啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，他是什么啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "我怎么会知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "快后退，与他保持距离！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "是本地的菲林吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "很难判断，我没有见过这种体型和长相的菲林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "是火龙喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "又一个出现了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "提高警惕！他们可能具有攻击性！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "时刻做好战斗准备！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "等一等......夜刀，你看他们的动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "（手舞足蹈）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "火龙！火龙喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "他们好像在跳舞，似乎......没有恶意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "嘿！你们是谁？是菲林吗？能听懂我说的话吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "好像不是菲林......是某种无智力的动物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "刚刚他们说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "没听清......是说爪痕吗？还是留下爪痕的生物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "你才没有智力喵！不礼貌的长角女人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "（指向地上的爪痕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "马上就要来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "说话了！说话了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "夜刀，他们好像说你不礼貌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "要来了？什么要来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黄色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "text": "没见过的道具喵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "啊！黄色的那个把俺们的仪器举起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "跑了！他跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "小工匠！停下喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "另一个也跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "快追上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "快跑喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "他们怎么跑得那么快啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "不要问我这种问题啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白色的奇怪生物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "text": "快跑，火龙要来了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "他们好像是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "什么要来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到现在，我还是会想起那个午后。\n糊满鞋底的泥土，二十三次毫无收获的采样。\n枯叶下的巨大爪痕，会跳舞的毛绒生物，下意识地感觉很像菲林。\n抱歉，这里没有不尊重菲林的意思。\n以及，笼罩在我们身上的庞大影子，仿佛一团灼烧大地的烈火。\n威胁自天空而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "黑角！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_502_Yato_1",
      "text": "准备迎战！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_500_noirc",
      "aliases": [
        "黑角"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
